  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The reference tool for whole-body CT and MRI anatomical segmentation — 100+ structures, one-line CLI, Apache-2.0, 2.7k stars, v2.5.0 (January 2025). Built on nnU-Net and published in Radiology AI 2023. Widely used in large-scale clinical cohort studies for automated organ volumetry and structure extraction. Complements nnU-Net in the MACH catalog: nnU-Net is the general-purpose training framework; TotalSegmentator is the ready-to-use pre-trained segmentation tool for radiology.",
